<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1822757830"/></metadata></head><body dur="5:29.317"><div begin="13.582" end="35.148" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="13.582" end="16.737" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="13.582" end="13.960">旁</span><span begin="13.960" end="15.153">人都问我</span><span begin="15.153" end="15.916">怎么愈</span><span begin="15.916" end="16.737">合</span></p><p begin="18.639" end="22.657" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="18.639" end="19.589">但质问离</span><span begin="19.589" end="20.058">去</span> <span begin="20.058" end="22.123">又有什么意义</span><span begin="22.123" end="22.657">呢</span></p><p begin="25.830" end="29.084" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="25.830" end="26.157">天</span><span begin="26.157" end="26.501">真</span><span begin="26.501" end="26.705">总</span><span begin="26.705" end="27.334">是</span><span begin="27.334" end="28.258">用错场</span><span begin="28.258" end="29.084">合</span></p><p begin="31.259" end="35.148" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="31.259" end="31.616">可</span><span begin="31.616" end="31.986">悲</span><span begin="31.986" end="32.170">的</span><span begin="32.170" end="32.901">是</span><span begin="32.901" end="33.355">我没</span><span begin="33.355" end="34.493">发现什</span><span begin="34.493" end="35.148">么</span></p></div><div begin="37.488" end="1:02.391" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="37.488" end="44.487" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="37.488" end="41.653">Ooh</span> <span begin="42.151" end="42.303">你</span><span begin="42.303" end="43.444">脚步的</span><span begin="43.444" end="43.671">慌</span><span begin="43.671" end="44.487">张</span></p><p begin="44.708" end="47.639" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="44.708" end="45.394">是名为</span><span begin="45.394" end="46.405">背叛的</span><span begin="46.405" end="46.693">交</span><span begin="46.693" end="47.639">响</span></p><p begin="49.833" end="56.704" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="49.833" end="53.773">Ooh</